   "t": "h2",
   "html": "Minelab X-Terra Voyager"
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "PROFESSIONAL DETECTING KIT."
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/detexpert-logosml_vfaa8qet.png\" alt=\"paul cee crawfords metal detectors\" title=\"paul cee metal detecting\" width=\"59\" height=\"88\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/YT-thumb_2020_krf9oxd0.png\" alt=\"minelab voyager details, metal detector that is cheap\" title=\"Minelab X-terra Voyager\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Minelab X-Terra VOYAGER comes with high-quality wired headphones for target ID, a sturdy backpack to secure your essentials and a folding shovel to recover buried treasure including all the tools you need for detecting coins, jewellry and gold."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "AUTOMATIC &amp; ACCURATE. Switch between search modes to find specific types of treasure. When you're zeroing in on one, switch to Pinpoint Mode for even greater precision. Distinct audio and visual alerts identify discoveries before you dig."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "EASY TO USE. The intuitive operation and large backlit screen 4\" ×2\" (10 cm x 5 cm) on the VOYAGER help make detecting a breeze, allowing you to focus on the thrill of the hunt rather than on complicated controls."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "COMPACT &amp; WATERPROOF. A lightweight, compact design allows you to carry it with ease. Easily adjust the height to suit adults of all sizes and children. The fully waterproof IP68 coil can go up to 3 ft deep so you can detect at the beach and in streams."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Minelab Voyager is powered with 2 9v batteries"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/voyager-pack.jpg\" alt=\"ideal metal detector for kids the minelab voyager\" title=\"minelab voyager metal detector\" width=\"302\" height=\"302\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Minelab X-terra Voyager Spec"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/voyager-spec.jpg\" alt=\"paul cee crawfords metal detectors\" title=\"minelab voyager paul cee\" width=\"194\" height=\"194\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "7 discrimination segements"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "99 Target I.d's"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "5 levels depth indicators"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "built in pinpointer"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/voyager-search-profiles.jpg\" alt=\"what search modes are on the minelab voyager\" title=\"minelab voyager search modes\" width=\"195\" height=\"195\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Search Modes All Metal, Jewellery, Custom and Learn"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/voyager-kit.jpg\" alt=\"full metal detecting kit that is cheap\" title=\"minelab x-terra voyager kit\" width=\"194\" height=\"194\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Collapsable to 28 in to fit in the included back-pack"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/voyager-screen.jpg\" alt=\"minelab voyager screen and controls\" title=\"paul cee metal detecting minelab voyager\" width=\"198\" height=\"198\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Easy to use and understand screen"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/voyager-coil.jpg\" alt=\"how waterproof is the minelab voyager\" title=\"paul cee minelab voyager coil\" width=\"197\" height=\"197\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Waterproof Coil to 1mtr"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Search Coil 11\"x8.5\" double D"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Find out more and <a href=\"https://bit.ly/xterravoyager\" data-kind=\"affiliate\">where to buy a Minelab X-Terra Voyager</a>"
  },
